cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MFTL in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MFTL: MultiFlow Triangulation Library"
abstract: >-
  A C11/MPI library for the distributed-memory manipulation of closed and open
  triangulated surface meshes, for front-tracking and immersed-boundary CFD:
  half-edge topology with implicit indexing, redistribution and ghost
  synchronisation, serial and distributed isotropic and curvature-adaptive
  remeshing, LBVH contact detection with exact predicates, breakup and
  coalescence by signed-distance reconstruction, and coupling to flow solvers.
authors:
